orte inteligente a qualquer momento do treinamento. Uma tecnologia criada para tornar o aprendizado mais acess\u00edvel, din\u00e2mico e envolvente.", "short_description": "Conhe\u00e7a o Assistente Virtual com IA da VRSchool."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_VRschool.png", "id": "1471508504488603", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604298355_1471508507821936_1033407612722260786_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yiJUNOgTTD0Q7kNvwFcCzhY&_nc_oc=AdpfKRL5fKAeyDL7UzGfIQro_bcRffFMXsx7_o3vb-2OnyEHCMIYNA6aVQj8_IG9rR4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS3OKB2H3ht-PpaU6wITclozUh16OIkjXYwqGMbaguJlw&oe=6B031FE3"}, {"file_name": "logo_VRSCHOOL.png", "id": "1449776713259284", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1449776716592617_1673567406847786742_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OmEZHz31s34Q7kNvwGNHd9j&_nc_oc=Adpnapq5im68KRneLeBDYJMjEV-S79QM8fuuV0PUSUfmtGSFOOrySWNmOEsqIvK3VV8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR76sxgqbXa_03tgb5B3e2aBKrUb8VG3eOntzUUoKTKNA&oe=6B0327E9"}, {"file_name": "icone_512x512.png", "id": "1278444900874844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825415_1278444904208177_5391998273224680991_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1u3GMl-23H0Q7kNvwFt1EDB&_nc_oc=AdrQDLbXGAQAcUYuFCnLtFntAvrQc-b4jQy9dafoqPROOdEb6FJPEk0zA76t_mcN97o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5hFK77gzA9g6rybfQtrTZkoxNpGu8CBsiqKvFqFeYKg&oe=6B0330A7"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_VRSCHOOL.png", "id": "1205723428036141", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_1205723434702807_6234410236425090773_n